## Tier Summary

- **Budget / High-throughput:** MiMo-V2.5, DeepSeek V4 Flash (sub-$0.30/1M output)
- **Mid-range:** MiniMax M3, MiniMax M2.7, Qwen3.7 Plus, Qwen3.6 Plus, DeepSeek V4 Pro
- **Flagship:** GLM-5.2, Kimi K2.7 Code, MiMo-V2.5-Pro, Qwen3.7 Max
